<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/49/eng@/~cl_13> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 141 of the Code is amended in paragraph (1)(c) by inserting after the words “mutatis mutandis,” the words “with the omission of paragraph (ca) and subparagraph (f)(i) of that subsection,”. Substitution of section 141A"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/49/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/49/eng@/~cl_14> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/49/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/49/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/49/eng@/~cl_14> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "14" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/49/eng@> .
