<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/49/eng@/~cl_16__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Land Administrator shall call upon the co-proprietor who applies to partition the said land to pay to him within a specified time—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/49/eng@> .
